# Data Quality Audit Skill
## Purpose
Audit dataset for missing values and structural data integrity.
## When to Use
Prior to running downstream statistical models or visualizations.
## Required Inputs
Raw dataframe `df`.
## Files Used
data/equipment_data.csv, final_report.qmd
## Method
Column-wise NA summation (`colSums(is.na(df))`).
## Procedure
Run quality audit code chunk in final_report.qmd.
## Validation
Verify zero missing values across all critical columns.
## Output
Named vector displaying count of missing values per variable.
## Interpretation
Confirms dataset completeness for modeling reliability.
## Limitation
Checks missingness only, not invalid numerical entry anomalies.